        NUM("1."),t("Foydalanuvchi o'z foydalanuvchi nomi (username) va parolidan olingan kalit yordamida shifrlangan vaqt belgisini (timestamp) Kalitlarni Tarqatish Markaziga (KDC — Key Distribution Center) yuboradi. KDC — bu odatda Domen Nazoratchisida o'rnatilgan va tarmoqda Kerberos chiptalarini yaratish uchun javobgar xizmatdir.","The user sends a timestamp encrypted with a key derived from their username and password to the Key Distribution Center (KDC). The KDC is a service, usually installed on the Domain Controller, responsible for creating Kerberos tickets on the network."),
        /*#__PURE__*/React.createElement("div",{style:{height:8}}),
        NUM("2."),t("KDC \"Chipta Beruvchi Chipta\" (TGT — Ticket Granting Ticket) yaratadi va uni foydalanuvchiga qaytaradi. Bu foydalanuvchiga muayyan xizmatlarga kirish uchun qo'shimcha chiptalarni talab qilish imkonini beradi. Ko'proq chipta olish uchun chipta kerak bo'lishi biroz g'alati tuyulishi mumkin, ammo bu foydalanuvchilarga har safar biror xizmatga ulanmoqchi bo'lganida o'z ma'lumotlarini (parollarini) qayta kiritmasdan, xizmat chiptalarini olish imkonini beradi. TGT bilan birga foydalanuvchiga \"Sessiya kaliti\" (Session Key) ham beriladi, u keyingi so'rovlarni yaratish uchun zarur bo'ladi.","The KDC creates a \"Ticket Granting Ticket\" (TGT) and returns it to the user. This allows the user to request additional tickets to access specific services. Needing a ticket to get more tickets may seem strange, but it lets users obtain service tickets without re-entering their password each time they want to connect to a service. Along with the TGT, the user also receives a \"Session Key\", which is needed to build subsequent requests.")
