      "Simply put, having a trust relationship between domains lets you grant a user in the THM UK domain access to MHT EU domain resources. The simplest trust relationship you can set up is a one-way trust. In a one-way trust, if Domain AAA trusts Domain BBB, it means a user in BBB can be granted access to AAA's resources:"
